Z||000014||Patrick||06-01-2000||03:03 PM||||<BR>That's right Marc, those are the guys. You must be "old" like me. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Living on the west coast, I've never had too many opportunities to watch Lindros play. I don't know if he's as dirty as some other players, but being such a big guy, he sure can hit. I agree with you completely though in your assessment of Lemieux. I've always disliked him because of his chippy play. However, he's the kind of player that unfortunately every team needs to win the cup. His record speaks for itself. He's the kind of player you hate when he plays for the opposition, but you love when he plays for the home team.<P>||||reg||14
