Z||000016||Patrick||06-01-2000||03:53 PM||||<BR>Lord Stanley's Mug.<P>Each spring the Stanley Cup is presented to the top National Hockey League team which is determined in the playoffs. I believe it is the oldest award in professional sport anywhere in the world.<P>This is a good a place as any to pay my respect to Maurice "Rocket" Richard who was just buried yesterday. His name certainly appeared on the Stanley Cup many times in all his years playing for the Montreal Canadiens.||||reg||1
